  "recordedAt": "2026-11-15",
  "segments": [
    {
      "startSec": 0,
      "endSec": 2.402,
      "text": "How do we know the Earth isn’t flat?"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 2.836,
      "endSec": 5.805,
      "text": "We Asked a NASA Scientist."
    },
    {
      "startSec": 6.139,
      "endSec": 7.474,
      "text": "That's a great question."
    },
    {
      "startSec": 7.474,
      "endSec": 10.477,
      "text": "In fact, two or three thousand years ago,"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 11.144,
      "endSec": 12.479,
      "text": "ancient people on this planet"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 12.479,
      "endSec": 13.313,
      "text": "that did great things"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 13.313,
      "endSec": 14.848,
      "text": "figured out that the Earth was round,"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 14.848,
      "endSec": 16.85,
      "text": "it was a sphere."
    },
    {
      "startSec": 16.85,
      "endSec": 19.452,
      "text": "This was a magical revelation"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 19.452,
      "endSec": 20.186,
      "text": "for the Greeks"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 20.186,
      "endSec": 20.854,
      "text": "and the Egyptians,"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 20.854,
      "endSec": 22.022,
      "text": "who were able to see"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 22.022,
      "endSec": 23.823,
      "text": "from the motions of the stars"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 23.823,
      "endSec": 25.592,
      "text": "and the way the Sun moved."
    },
    {
      "startSec": 25.592,
      "endSec": 26.626,
      "text": "They saw the way"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 26.626,
      "endSec": 28.061,
      "text": "the Sun's shadow"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 28.061,
      "endSec": 29.796,
      "text": "worked in different places."
    },
    {
      "startSec": 29.796,
      "endSec": 31.231,
      "text": "And they figured, well,"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 31.231,
      "endSec": 32.432,
      "text": "that's only possible"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 32.432,
      "endSec": 33.767,
      "text": "if the Earth is round."
    },
    {
      "startSec": 33.767,
      "endSec": 35.335,
      "text": "And they took that information"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 35.335,
      "endSec": 36.736,
      "text": "and it extended"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 36.736,
      "endSec": 38.772,
      "text": "into the time of the great mariners"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 38.772,
      "endSec": 40.707,
      "text": "that explored our Earth by ships."
    },
    {
      "startSec": 40.707,
      "endSec": 41.441,
      "text": "They made the first"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 41.441,
      "endSec": 42.542,
      "text": "orbit of Earth by sea,"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 42.542,
      "endSec": 43.643,
      "text": "and they knew"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 43.643,
      "endSec": 46.112,
      "text": "the Earth was round, allowing them to go"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 46.112,
      "endSec": 47.58,
      "text": "across one ocean and come back home"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 47.58,
      "endSec": 48.715,
      "text": "the other way."
    },
    {
      "startSec": 48.715,
      "endSec": 49.449,
      "text": "If the Earth were flat,"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 49.449,
      "endSec": 51.084,
      "text": "they would have sailed off the end."
    },
    {
      "startSec": 51.084,
      "endSec": 52.118,
      "text": "And so we knew that."
    },
    {
      "startSec": 52.118,
      "endSec": 53.053,
      "text": "But then,"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 53.053,
      "endSec": 54.821,
      "text": "at the dawn of the space age,"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 54.821,
      "endSec": 56.823,
      "text": "in the late 50s and 60s,"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 56.823,
      "endSec": 59.125,
      "text": "we were able to see for ourselves"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 59.125,
      "endSec": 60.86,
      "text": "that our beautiful home"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 60.86,
      "endSec": 62.462,
      "text": "is a gorgeous round"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 62.462,
      "endSec": 63.83,
      "text": "object known as a sphere."
    },
    {
      "startSec": 63.83,
      "endSec": 65.732,
      "text": "And that was really special."
    },
    {
      "startSec": 65.732,
      "endSec": 67.267,
      "text": "It put ourselves into context"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 67.267,
      "endSec": 69.736,
      "text": "of our solar system and our universe."
    },
    {
      "startSec": 69.736,
      "endSec": 71.137,
      "text": "We have a big round Sun"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 71.137,
      "endSec": 72.572,
      "text": "and a beautiful round Earth"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 72.572,
      "endSec": 73.74,
      "text": "and a round Mars."
    },
    {
      "startSec": 73.74,
      "endSec": 74.474,
      "text": "And today"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 74.474,
      "endSec": 76.276,
      "text": "we use the roundness of Earth,"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 76.276,
      "endSec": 77.544,
      "text": "the spherical Earth,"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 77.544,
      "endSec": 80.313,
      "text": "to use methods in space geodesy"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 80.313,
      "endSec": 82.282,
      "text": "to figure out where we are,"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 82.282,
      "endSec": 83.416,
      "text": "where we're going."
    },
    {
      "startSec": 83.416,
      "endSec": 85.251,
      "text": "I haven't been lost in years."
    },
    {
      "startSec": 85.251,
      "endSec": 86.152,
      "text": "That's pretty good."
    },
    {
      "startSec": 86.152,
      "endSec": 87.487,
      "text": "What's happening to the Earth,"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 87.487,
      "endSec": 88.922,
      "text": "what's happening to our oceans"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 88.922,
      "endSec": 90.757,
      "text": "as we take the pulse of our planet"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 90.757,
      "endSec": 92.192,
      "text": "and consider other worlds"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 92.192,
      "endSec": 93.993,
      "text": "beyond as we explore those."
    },
    {
      "startSec": 93.993,
      "endSec": 95.328,
      "text": "So as we get ready"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 95.328,
      "endSec": 96.696,
      "text": "to go back to the Moon"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 96.696,
      "endSec": 97.664,
      "text": "with women and men"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 97.664,
      "endSec": 98.998,
      "text": "and explore other worlds,"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 98.998,
      "endSec": 101.301,
      "text": "the roundness of our solar system"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 101.301,
      "endSec": 103.536,
      "text": "and our universe is a special thing."
    },
    {
      "startSec": 103.536,
      "endSec": 105.038,
      "text": "And we should embrace that"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 105.038,
      "endSec": 106.172,
      "text": "as we understand"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 106.172,
      "endSec": 107.34,
      "text": "why our planet isn't flat."
    },
    {
      "startSec": 108.074,
      "endSec": 110.009,
      "text": "We Asked a NASA Scientist."
    },
    {
      "startSec": 110.009,
      "endSec": 113.279,
      "text": "NASA. A NASA 360 Production."
    }
  ]
}
